:: MP Region Velvet AbacusWaxLetter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>>
私人拍卖暗厅后台的记账桌抽屉半开着，一把象牙算盘下压着一封火漆信。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
你从算盘下抽出信，火漆已经开裂，信里夹着一张拍卖委托单。
<br><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[抽出火漆信 (0:07)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 7>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[拆开信封 (0:07)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<skulduggery 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_velvet_abacuswaxletter_reward")>><<money 932>><</if>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_region_ev_velvet_abacuswaxletter")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">拆开信封 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><</link>><<lstress>>

:: MP Region Velvet DumbwaiterRosewoodBox [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
